{
  "message": "I can help. Because you’re abroad, the most common causes are roaming not enabled (on the line or on the phone), mobile data or data saver toggles, VPN interference, using an older network mode, or hitting your plan’s data limit. I’ll do two things in parallel: 1) check your account/line to confirm roaming status and data usage, and 2) guide you through quick on‑device checks to restore excellent speeds.",
  "what_i_need_from_you": {
    "for_account_lookup": [
      "Phone number for the affected line (best option), OR",
      "Customer ID, OR",
      "Full name + date of birth (YYYY-MM-DD)"
    ],
    "about_your_device": [
      "Phone type (iPhone or Android) and model (if you know it)",
      "Can you place/receive regular calls and SMS right now?"
    ]
  },
  "on_device_checks": {
    "step_1_check_network_status": "On your phone, run check_network_status and share the results here (airplane mode, signal bars, network type like 4G/5G/3G, Mobile Data ON/OFF, Data Roaming ON/OFF).",
    "step_2_speed_test": "Run run_speed_test and share the result (e.g., no connection/very poor/poor/fair/good/excellent).",
    "step_3_quick_settings": [
      "If airplane mode is ON, turn it OFF using toggle_airplane_mode.",
      "Ensure Mobile Data is ON using toggle_data (turn it ON if OFF).",
      "Turn Data Roaming ON using toggle_roaming (important while in France)."
    ],
    "step_4_optimize_network_mode": "Run check_network_mode_preference. If it shows 2G or 3G, set to 4g_5g_preferred using set_network_mode_preference to allow best speeds.",
    "step_5_data_saver_and_vpn": [
      "Run check_data_restriction_status. If Data Saver is ON, turn it OFF using toggle_data_saver_mode.",
      "Run check_vpn_status. If a VPN is connected and speeds are poor, disconnect it using disconnect_vpn."
    ]
  },
  "what_i_might_change_on_your_account": [
    "If your line’s international roaming is disabled, I will enable it at no cost so data works in France.",
    "If you’ve used your monthly data, I’ll let you know your options: refuel up to 2 GB (priced per your plan) or change plans. I’ll confirm pricing before doing anything."
  ],
  "next": "Please provide your phone number (or other lookup info) and share the outputs from step 1 and step 2. If it’s easier, you can go through steps 3–5 now and tell me what you changed. I’ll start checking your account as soon as I have your identifier."
}

