  "message": "I’m sorry you’re dealing with slow or dropping mobile data. Here’s how I’ll help: First I’ll verify your account and the line to rule out issues like a suspended line or hitting your monthly data limit. Then I’ll guide you through quick device checks (network mode, Data Saver, VPN, APN, etc.) to restore excellent speeds. Please share a few details so I can start.",
  "why_these_steps": "Account/line problems (suspension or out-of-data) can stop data entirely. If the line is fine, device settings like network mode, Data Saver, VPN, or APN are common causes of slow/no data. We’ll address them in order of impact.",
  "requests": [
    {
      "field": "identifier",
      "prompt": "Please provide ONE of the following so I can locate your account: (a) the phone number on the affected line, (b) your customer ID, or (c) your full name AND date of birth (YYYY-MM-DD)."
    },
    {
      "field": "traveling",
      "prompt": "Are you currently traveling outside your usual coverage area or country? (Yes/No and where)"
    },
    {
      "field": "wifi_status",
      "prompt": "Is Wi‑Fi currently ON? For testing mobile data, please turn Wi‑Fi OFF and confirm."
    },
    {
      "field": "calls_texts",
      "prompt": "Do regular calls and SMS texts work right now? (Yes/No)"
    },
    {
      "field": "status_bar",
      "prompt": "What do you see in the status bar: signal bars (none/1/2/3/4) and network type (5G/4G/3G/2G)? Any airplane mode icon?"
    },
    {
      "field": "vpn_datasaver",
      "prompt": "Are you using a VPN, and is Data Saver enabled? (VPN On/Off, Data Saver On/Off)"
    },
    {
      "field": "when_started",
      "prompt": "When did the issue start, and is it happening everywhere or in a specific location?"
    }
  ],
  "next_steps_after_info": "I will look up your line, check for suspension or data-limit issues, confirm roaming settings, and then guide you step-by-step to optimize network mode (4G/5G), turn off Data Saver if needed, disconnect VPN if it’s causing slow speeds, verify APN settings, and run a speed test to confirm improvement."
}

