      "how": "Run check_network_mode_preference(). If it shows 2G or 3G, set set_network_mode_preference(\"4g_5g_preferred\")."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "action": "Force a fresh network attach (if it still shows 2G)",
      "how": "Use toggle_airplane_mode() to turn it ON for ~10 seconds, then OFF. Recheck with check_network_status() to see if it connects to 4G/5G."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "action": "Turn OFF Data Saver and any VPN (for testing)",
      "how": "Run check_data_restriction_status() and check_vpn_status(). If Data Saver is ON, use toggle_data_saver_mode() to turn it OFF. If a VPN is connected, use disconnect_vpn()."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "action": "Test your speed",
      "how": "With Wi‑Fi OFF, run run_speed_test(). We’re aiming for an “excellent” rating."
