    "Are you currently traveling outside your usual/home network area (roaming)? Yes/No.",
    "If MMS fails during the test, what exact error message appears?"
  ],
  "what_to_report_back": [
    "Result of can_send_mms.",
    "Data Saver/VPN status and any changes you made.",
